{%- comment -%}
  Checkout button + Shopify / Checkout Champ routing, shared by the cart drawer
  and the cart page so the two cannot drift apart.

  @param button_size (string, optional) defaults to 'default'
  @param button_id (string, optional)

  ROUTING — cc-cart.js.liquid (rendered globally from theme.liquid) binds to
  `[type="submit"][name="checkout2"]` and redirects to Checkout Champ. Anything
  named "checkout" falls through to Shopify's own checkout, which is what the
  Insiders Club page promises Full Price shoppers: "no trial or recurring
  membership charge, standard Shopify checkout".

  A cart holding the Insiders Club ALWAYS goes to Checkout Champ, whatever the
  pricing mode. The membership is a recurring $24.95/month charge on a Checkout
  Champ billing schedule; Shopify's checkout cannot create it. Routing on the
  pricing mode alone missed the one cart that can legitimately sit on Full Price
  with a Club line — a standalone enrollment, which has no merchandise for the
  pricing mode to apply to — and sent it through Shopify, taking the money for a
  $0 item and enrolling nobody.

  The cart page previously hardcoded name="checkout2", so Full Price carts there
  went to Checkout Champ too. That is fixed by going through this snippet.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign fs_mode = cart.attributes.pricing_mode | default: 'insider'
  assign fs_club_product = settings.insider_mode_free_product

  assign fs_has_club = false
  if fs_club_product != blank
    for fs_line in cart.items
      if fs_line.product_id == fs_club_product.id
        assign fs_has_club = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  assign fs_use_cc = false
  if fs_mode == 'insider' or fs_has_club
    assign fs_use_cc = true
  endif

  if fs_use_cc
    assign buttonAttributes = 'type="submit" name="checkout2" form="cart" data-fs-cc-checkout'
  else
    assign buttonAttributes = 'type="submit" name="checkout" form="cart" data-fs-native-checkout'
  endif

  assign fs_button_size = button_size | default: 'default'
  assign buttonText = 'sections.cart.checkout' | t

  render 'button', type: 'button', id: button_id, button_size: fs_button_size, button_text: buttonText, buttonAttributes: buttonAttributes
-%}
